## 📌 Project Description

The Pet Care Website is a modern and user-friendly UI/UX design created in Figma as part of my CodeAlpha UI/UX Design Internship. 

The objective of this project was to design an intuitive and visually appealing website that helps pet owners easily access pet care services, learn about available facilities, and connect with professionals.

The design process started with wireframing to establish the layout and user flow, followed by creating a high-fidelity interface using consistent typography, color palettes, and reusable components. 

The website focuses on providing a clean navigation experience, responsive layouts, and an engaging visual design that enhances usability across different devices.

This project helped me strengthen my skills in wireframing, visual design, user experience principles, responsive layouts, auto layout, components, and interactive prototyping using Figma.

🎯 Objectives

- Design a clean and modern Pet Care website.
- Create an intuitive and user-friendly interface.
- Improve navigation and overall user experience.
- Apply responsive design principles.
- Use Figma components and Auto Layout effectively.

🛠️ Tools Used

- Figma
- Auto Layout
- Components
- Variants
- Interactive Prototyping

